<title>FRANCE: Degremont H1 profit falls.</title>
<headline>Degremont H1 profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end June, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable				55  vs	   65</p>
<p>    Total Net					 65  vs	   70</p>
<p>    Pre tax, pre exceptional		   141  up   10.5 pct</p>
<p>    Turnover				     2,415  vs	2,143</p>
<p>NOTE - Degremont is a unit of Lyonnaise des Eaux. It gave its results in a statement. Degremont said its orders rose more than 30 percent to 1,270 million francs in the first half of 1996 compared to the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
